<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine chicken output 571,000 T in 1996.</title>
<headline>Argentine chicken output 571,000 T in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine chicken meat output was 571,000 tonnes in 1996, slightly down from the previous year's 580,000 tonnes but 80 percent higher than a decade ago, the government's Agriculture Secretariat said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Argentina's chicken output goes almost exclusively to the domestic market.</p>
<p>Per capita chicken consumption has risen 70 percent over the past 10 years to 21 kilograms a year, according to the Secretariat.</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
